/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Scratch output from manual `observe --out` / capture runs, which land in the
# repo root. These are screenshots of a real desktop and must never reach git or
# a crate tarball.
#
# Root-anchored on purpose: a blanket *.png would also swallow a docs diagram or
# any asset added under a subdirectory later, silently. Scratch files appear
# here, so this is where the rule belongs.
/*.png
/*.txt
